ZXCPM related tools (cross development, disk editing, etc)


Cross development compiler kit:
----------------------------------

The BASIC Compiler is an exact conversion of an early version, all the original functionalities (and limits) should match.

The Fortran-80 compiler is a hack.

The BDS C compiler is the recent v1.6 as originally built by Kamil, with some more file taken from the original BDS package.

